        "agm_result": "Agenda #1: Shareholders approved the 2025 Annual Report and Financial Statements audited by Purwanto, Susanti & Surja, granting full discharge to the Board of Directors and Commissioners.\nAgenda #2: The meeting approved the allocation of Rp 1.1 trillion in net profit toward reserve funds, cash dividends totaling Rp 701 billion, and retained earnings.\nAgenda #3: Authority was granted to the Board of Commissioners to appoint an OJK-registered Public Accountant for the 2026 fiscal year and determine their professional fees.\nAgenda #4: No discussion or decision was made regarding changes to the composition of the Board of Commissioners or Directors as no shareholder proposals were received.\nAgenda #5: The Board of Commissioners was authorized to establish the 2026 remuneration system, including salaries and bonuses, for both the Board of Directors and Commissioners.\nAgenda #6: This item served as a formal report on the realization of the utilization of Initial Public Offering (IPO) proceeds and required no shareholder resolution.\nAgenda #7: Shareholders approved a revised plan for IPO proceeds, allocating funds for company acquisitions, a kernel crushing plant, a biogas power plant, and working capital for PT Cipta Davia Mandiri.\nAgenda #8: The Board of Directors for the 2024-2027 period includes President Director Wishnu Wardhana and five directors, though the decision status for this item is not stated.\nAgenda #9: The Board of Commissioners for the 2024-2027 period includes President Commissioner Indracahya Basuki and Independent Commissioner Iwa Kartiwa Hudaya, though the decision status for this item is not stated."
